                ],
                [
                    117.0,
                    695.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Use commas to separate items in a series if the items have no internal punctuation. Use semicolons to set off items in a series if they do.",
            "block_bbox": [
